  "description": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Bosworth Independent School is a co-educational day and boarding school in Northampton for ages 11-19 (Year 7 to Sixth Form), part of CATS Global Schools.",
      "Founded in 1986, the school offers Year 7-9 (Key Stage 3), GCSE (2-year and 1-year fast track), A-Level, and University Foundation Programme (UFP) with three pathway specialisms.",
      "Notable scholarships: five 100% A-Level scholarships for domestic students, plus Francis Crick and Joan Wake scholarships (100%) for international students from South East Asia.",
      "A-Level destinations include Durham University, Imperial College London, and University of Warwick."
    ],
    "keyFacts": [
      "Founded 1986",
      "Co-educational, ages 11-19",
      "Part of CATS Global Schools",
      "Programmes: Year 7-9, GCSE, A-Level, UFP (3 pathways)",
      "International tuition £15,495 / year (Year 7-11)",
      "Six boarding houses (separate by gender + age)"
    ],
    "paragraphsRu": [
      "Bosworth Independent School — независимая совместная дневная и пансионная школа в Northampton для возраста 11-19 лет (Year 7 — Sixth Form), часть группы CATS Global Schools.",
      "Школа основана в 1986 году. Программы: Year 7-9 (Key Stage 3), GCSE (2 года или ускоренная 1-летняя), A-Level и University Foundation Programme (UFP) по трём специализациям.",
      "Известна щедрыми стипендиями: пять 100% A-Level стипендий для местных студентов, плюс стипендии Francis Crick и Joan Wake (100%) для иностранных студентов из Юго-Восточной Азии.",
